@startuml
title component-proposal - code
component "workspace-manifests.mjs\nproposeComponents" as Propose
component "components.mjs\nlistComponents, readComponents" as Components
component "roadmap.mjs\ngetRoadmap" as Roadmap
component "workflow-init and design skills" as Skills
Roadmap --> Components : declared components and problem
Roadmap --> Propose : proposal when none are declared
Roadmap ..> Components : checks the proposed block
Skills ..> Roadmap : get_roadmap, offer the proposal to the person
@enduml
